  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Government of Mozambique and Belgium have been working together in the fight against poverty since 2001, when several provinces were affected by flooding. Many efforts are made to improve access to resources, infrastructure and services, in particular in the most vulnerable rural areas.    &lt;b&gt;Enabel has an office in Maputo.&lt;/b&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
